  "worked_solution": "Let's examine our statement:\n\n- The word \"any\" indicates that we use a universal quantifier, $\u2200.$\n\n- The sentence refers to two integers. So, by denoting our numbers as $a$ and $b,$ we have\n\n$$\n\u2200\\,a,b\\in Z.\n$$\n\n- Finally, the condition in the statement can be written as follows:\n\n$$\n(a\u2223ab)\\,\u2227\\,(b\u2223ab)\n$$\n\nTherefore, we write the statement as follows:\n\n$\u2200a,b\\in Z,\\,(a\u2223ab)\\,\u2227\\,(b\u2223ab)$",
